"Toolbox keeps every version of each IDE it installed. Remove old versions in Toolbox under Settings." = "Toolbox 保留它安装的每个 IDE 的每个版本。可在 Toolbox 的“设置”中移除旧版本。";
"Open Toolbox" = "打开 Toolbox";
"itch installs games here. Uninstall one from its page in the itch app." = "itch 把游戏安装在这里。可在 itch 应用中该游戏的页面上卸载。";
"Open itch" = "打开 itch";
"Steam's own data. The games are under Apps outside Applications, where each can be uninstalled in Steam." = "Steam 自身的数据。游戏在“‘应用程序’文件夹之外的应用”下，每个都可以在 Steam 中卸载。";
"Mail keeps a copy of every message and attachment here. Mail > Settings > Accounts lets you download only recent attachments, and Mailbox > Erase Junk Mail and Erase Deleted Items free space." = "邮件会在这里保存每封邮件和附件的副本。在“邮件”>“设置”>“帐户”中可以只下载最近的附件；“邮箱”>“抹掉垃圾邮件”和“抹掉已删除的项目”可释放空间。";
"Open Mail" = "打开邮件";
"Messages keeps the photos and videos from your conversations here. Messages > Settings > General > Keep messages sets how long they stay." = "信息会把对话中的照片和视频保存在这里。“信息”>“设置”>“通用”>“保留信息”可设置保留多久。";
"Open Messages" = "打开信息";
"Your Photos library. With iCloud Photos on, Photos > Settings > iCloud > Optimize Mac Storage keeps full-size originals in iCloud and smaller copies here." = "你的照片图库。开启 iCloud 照片后，“照片”>“设置”>“iCloud”>“优化 Mac 储存空间”会把全尺寸原件放在 iCloud，这里只保留较小的副本。";
"Open Photos" = "打开照片";
"Films and shows downloaded in the TV app. Remove downloads from the Library in TV." = "在 TV 应用中下载的影片和节目。可在 TV 的“资料库”中移除下载。";
"Open TV" = "打开 TV";
"Your Music library and downloads. Remove downloads from the Library in Music." = "你的音乐资料库和下载。可在“音乐”的“资料库”中移除下载。";
"Open Music" = "打开音乐";
"iMovie keeps its libraries and rendered projects here. Delete old projects and events in iMovie." = "iMovie 把资料库和渲染好的项目放在这里。可在 iMovie 中删除旧项目和事件。";
"Open iMovie" = "打开 iMovie";
"GarageBand projects and the sounds it downloaded. Remove sound packs in GarageBand under Sound Library." = "GarageBand 的项目和它下载的声音。可在 GarageBand 的“声音资源库”中移除声音包。";
"Open GarageBand" = "打开 GarageBand";
"Docker Desktop keeps its disk image here. It only shrinks from inside Docker: remove unused images and containers, or lower the disk image size under Settings > Resources." = "Docker Desktop 把磁盘映像放在这里。只能从 Docker 内部缩小：移除未使用的镜像和容器，或在“Settings”>“Resources”中调低磁盘映像大小。";
"Open Docker" = "打开 Docker";
"The models in here are listed one by one on the Large Files tab, where each can be removed." = "这里的模型会在“大文件”标签页中逐个列出，可在那里移除。";
"Hugging Face keeps every model you downloaded here. Remove one with the huggingface-cli delete-cache command, or delete its folder under hub." = "Hugging Face 把你下载的每个模型放在这里。可用 huggingface-cli delete-cache 命令移除，或删除 hub 下对应的文件夹。";
"Xcode's caches, simulators and archives are on the Dev Tools tab." = "Xcode 的缓存、模拟器和归档在“开发工具”标签页中。";
"Files every user on this Mac can see. Anything here is yours to tidy in Finder." = "这台 Mac 上所有用户都能看到的文件。这里的内容可由你在访达中整理。";
"Another user's home folder. Only that user, or an administrator in System Settings > Users & Groups, can remove it." = "另一个用户的个人文件夹。只有该用户，或管理员在“系统设置”>“用户与群组”中，才能移除它。";
"Open Everything else" = "打开“其他内容”";
"Stopped before it could measure" = "统计开始前已停止";
"macOS, your files, app data and more. Click to see what's in it" = "macOS、你的文件、应用数据等。点按查看其中有什么";
"macOS, your files, app data and more" = "macOS、你的文件、应用数据等";
"Up next, after the scan that is running" = "接下来，在当前扫描之后";
"Measuring your home folder and Library…" = "正在统计个人文件夹和资源库…";
"Not measured yet" = "尚未统计";
"Measured %@" = "%@统计";

/* Everything else map (#220) */
"Double-click a group to open it" = "连按两下某个组可打开它";
"Click Everything else in the crumb to go back" = "点按路径中的“其他内容”可返回";
"Hover a tile for its size and share. Tiles under 3 points are not drawn." = "将指针悬停在方块上可查看大小和占比。小于 3 点的方块不绘制。";
"Hover a folder for its path and size." = "将指针悬停在文件夹上可查看路径和大小。";
"In Large Files" = "在“大文件”中";
"Has its own uninstall" = "有自己的卸载方式";
"Under %@ each, with any loose files" = "每个小于 %@，包括零散文件";
"%@, %@, %@" = "%@，%@，%@";
